# This repo is not built from its own Dockerfile — it reaches a build as a NAMED BuildKit context.
# The e2e harness passes it as `sdk` (`additional_contexts: sdk: ${FLANJ_WORKSPACE}/sdk`) and
# graph/org-app/Dockerfile does `COPY --from=sdk / ./` before `yarn install && yarn build`, so the
# WHOLE of this directory is transferred on every lane. Without this file there was no ignore list
# at all: BuildKit logged `[org-app context sdk] load .dockerignore` and found nothing.
#
# Every session works in a `.claude/worktrees/<slug>` worktree (the workspace CLAUDE.md makes that
# mandatory) and they accumulate — 1.5 GB of the 1.65 GB context here on 2026-09-12, each carrying
# its own node_modules. None of it is reachable from the build: the org-app image copies the
# context root and then installs from the lockfile.
.claude/
.worktrees/

# Build inputs only; `yarn build` (tsc -b) regenerates everything else.
.git/
.DS_Store
